[{"id": 187167870, "text": "763382514", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "VIDEO", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2944, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 41929360, "text": "<ol>\n<li>Choose a word from the word mat.</li>\n<li>Act out the word, e.g. 'fast'. </li>\n<li>Can you do it a bit more? Then you will be 'faster'. </li>\n<li>Now can you do it the most you possibly can? Now you are 'fastest'. </li>\n<li>Now you're ready to play the game! </li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\n<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Player 1 chooses a word off the word mat and Player 2 does the action. </li>\n<li>Player 1 changes how much Player 1 is doing the action by adding 'er' and 'est'. </li>\n<li>Player 1 keeps changing the word by using 'er' and 'est' (or no ending) so that Player 1 has to keep changing what they are doing.</li>\n<li>Now swap over so the other person gets a turn! </li>\n<li>Keep taking it in turns to choose a word.</li>\n</ol>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableD